'''Rumi's Concoction''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Granite Flask}}. 


{{Item acquisition|acquisition_insert=<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/pathofexile/comments/odityy/comment/h41wtpm/</ref><ref>https://youtu.be/RskRFwgoQ5g?si=eR2RnY7L9vFhzKH3&t=734</ref>}}


==Ruthless mode==
Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a flask duration of 4.00 seconds instead.

==Design attribution==
Rumi's Concoction was created by supporter [https://www.pathofexile.com/account/view-profile/Soroban Soroban].{{citation needed}}

